N[(7,0)][2]=("What teachers should do","The good news: pupils already reread sensibly, so teachers need not train the rereading. The bad news: inaccurate monitoring is everywhere; even college students struggle to tell which texts they know well. So teachers should train the <b>judging</b>: say what students should learn, <b>describe the test explicitly</b>, and <b>test deep understanding</b> rather than facts. Students adjust how they read and monitor to the test they expect.")
